#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The PSOE is torn between different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @class_struggle: The Republic is not an end in itself but an intermediate stage and an instrument in the achievement of socialism, so collaboration with it is circumstantial
- @labor: We should work with the trade unions from inside the goverment to improve the lives of workers. 
- @reform: We need to collaborate with the other republican forces to consolidate the Republic and institute social reforms.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "caballeristas") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "caballeristas"; caballeristas_strength += 10; communist_coalition += 1; caballeristas_dissent -= 5; prr_relation -= 3; prrs_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; pce_relation += 3

The Caballeristas a course of class struggle, and potentially a alliance with the Communists.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "besteiristas") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "besteiristas"; besteiristas_strength += 10; wtb_support += 1; besteiristas_dissent -= 5; pce_relation -= 3

The Besteorostas supports continued particpation in government in order to provide benefits to the workers, and the creation of public works programs for employment.

@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "prietistas") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "prietistas"; prietistas_strength += 10; democratization += 1; prietistas_dissent -= 5; prr_relation += 5; prrs_relation += 5; dlr_relation += 5; ar_relation += 5; pce_relation -= 8; moderate_plan_support += 1

The Prietistas seeks to preserve the Republic and the democratic system of government, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other pro-democracy parties.

@changed
on-arrival: caballeristas_dissent += 5; besteiristas_dissent += 5; prietistas_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
